WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
I’m Christopher Han, co-founder of KICE Arena. I have planned and organized tech events.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
I helped organize and plan the SCSC programming contest, with around 300 participants.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
I also helped plan and run the SKYSH hackathon, with around 100 participants from five schools.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
I use Codex for ML competitions, KICE Arena development, and reels-production automation.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
I’ll host hands-on sessions where people improve their own work with Codex, and share the examples.
